      "id": "ppj-exec-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0\n\nDomain:\nSourcing / Purchasing\n\nLifecycle:\nCloseout Preparation\n\nProgress:\nTBD\n\nGate:\nProduction monitoring, data quality and retrieval quality\n\nOutcome:\nOne production application for supplier/material intelligence: Supplier Data + Material Data + Search + Comparison + RAG + Chatbot.\n\nTop Blocker:\nManual external-data input\n\nNext Milestone:\nClean missing fields, mixed types, duplicates and naming\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-09-18",
